@startuml SM04
title SM04 – Trang thai Zalo Message Queue

[*] --> PENDING : Admin/GV them vao hang doi

PENDING    --> PROCESSING : Worker lay de xu ly
PROCESSING --> SENT       : Gui Zalo thanh cong
PROCESSING --> PENDING    : That bai, retry_count < 3\n(cho 5 phut)
PROCESSING --> FAILED     : That bai, retry_count = 3
PENDING    --> CANCELLED  : SV da nop BC (deadline reminder)\nhoac Admin huy

SENT      --> [*]
FAILED    --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]

state PENDING    : priority + scheduled_at
state PROCESSING : dang gui qua Zalo API
state SENT       : sent_at = NOW()
state FAILED     : failed_reason luu lai
state CANCELLED  : khong can gui nua

@enduml
